<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Status constants you can use:
</p>
<ul><li>WM_GUI_STATUS_NO_USE = 0 (unavailable from area map)</li>
<li>WM_GUI_STATUS_READ_ONLY = 1 (available from area map, cannot travel)</li>
<li>WM_GUI_STATUS_USE = 2 (available from area map, click pin to travel)</li></ul>
